This repository is a fork of turbodrone. The turbodrone code in turbodrone/ was
imported unchanged from upstream commit 2c09cf8 (this repository's commit 1aff2b5).
Upstream files that the import missed because of ignore rules were added later,
byte-identical to 2c09cf8 (commits 09d005e and 15a5f80).

Russell Van Curen modified and deleted some of those turbodrone files in
November 2026 (the operator UI in turbodrone/frontend, the backend web_server.py,
and the removed follow plugin). THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists them, and
`git diff 1aff2b5 HEAD -- turbodrone/` shows every change.

